From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Ship the licences of the third-party code compiled into the
 extensions

The wheel's extensions compile in code from five other projects under
their own permissive licences, each of which requires its notice to
travel with binary redistributions: the VMD molfile plugin library
(University of Illinois Open Source License; mdtraj.formats.dcd and the
plugin headers of mdtraj.formats.dtr), D. E. Shaw Research's dtrplugin
(BSD-3-Clause; mdtraj.formats.dtr), the xdrfile library (BSD-2-Clause;
mdtraj.formats.xtc and .trr), Jacob Frelinger's Munkres implementation
(BSD; mdtraj._lprmsd) and OpenMM's vectorization headers (MIT; the
mdtraj.geometry extensions). The notices only live in the source file
headers, so every published wheel carries mdtraj's own LGPL LICENSE alone.

Add one LICENSE.<component> file per component at the project root,
reproducing the notice its sources carry (the VMD sources only carry the
copyright line, so the UIUC Open Source License text is taken from the
VMD plugin library's licence page). setuptools' default license_files
glob already matches LICENSE.* at the root, so no setup.py change is
needed and the files land in dist-info/licenses/.

Upstream-Status: To upstream [not submitted from this automated port run; needs a pull request against mdtraj/mdtraj]
---
 LICENSE.dtrplugin   | 32 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 LICENSE.munkres     | 13 +++++++++++++
 LICENSE.openmm      | 32 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 LICENSE.vmd-plugins | 45 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 LICENSE.xdrfile     | 26 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 148 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 LICENSE.dtrplugin
 create mode 100644 LICENSE.munkres
 create mode 100644 LICENSE.openmm
 create mode 100644 LICENSE.vmd-plugins
 create mode 100644 LICENSE.xdrfile

